OL,3,GNEWSANotting Hill Carnival 2026:
OL,4,AEverything you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FNotting Hill Carnival will mark its
OL,7,F60th anniversary this bank holiday
OL,8,Fweekend, with the streets of west
OL,9,FLondon set to come alive with music,
OL,10,Fcostumes and celebration.
OL,12,FEurope's largest street carnival takes
OL,13,Fplace from 29 to 31 August, with
OL,14,Fmillions of people expected to attend
OL,15,Fthe annual celebration of Caribbean
OL,16,Fculture.
OL,18,FFirst launched in 1966, Notting Hill
OL,19,FCarnival brings together communities
OL,20,Fthrough sound systems, parades and
OL,21,Fperformances.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
